{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2017-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1511395200, "end_date": 1512086399, "month_true_total": 55, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:54:36 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "37937289", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986889735", "personaname": "Pvt. Pirate", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pvt_pirate/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 1067, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 547, "last_played": 1512674062, "avatar": "d15de53dc57a5372dbb79fbcd9f97048d6efd757"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely nice game! stunning atmosphere and as far as i can see inside the lore.\nwell, you can chose more than a pistol, a melee and a main weapon, but it's only ONE more.\nand the autogun didnt slow you down while the heavy bolter did, but other than that, it's awesome! (maybe they didn't want to slow down the endgame...)\nThe story has a nice suspension with twists and turns and it runs at a stable 60fps with vsync on this PC.", "timestamp_created": 1511986972, "timestamp_updated": 1511986972, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "37916406", "author": {"steamid": "76561198060482338", "personaname": "Oblivious", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198060482338/", "num_games_owned": 121, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 1096, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1069, "last_played": 1634692183, "avatar": "e09b9e193480b2c76504bf904712116f8cc301d5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Greatest 40k game as of 2019\n\nPros\n- Combat\n- Sound\n- Immersion\n\nCons\n- Short game length\n- Dead multiplayer", "timestamp_created": 1511918921, "timestamp_updated": 1549755365, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.488532096147537231", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "37914453", "author": {"steamid": "76561197965259629", "personaname": "Draxalon", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197965259629/", "num_games_owned": 345, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 646, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 646, "last_played": 1511911185, "avatar": "46469ef15df1b60ea9f8a5d42e2f9c9e3f65c775"}, "language": "english", "review": "8-10 hour single player campaign. No joke. Was OK, but not for the price.", "timestamp_created": 1511911307, "timestamp_updated": 1511911307, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471410214900970459", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "37892896", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978218808", "personaname": "REH_BlackJack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/76561197978218808/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2241, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1715, "last_played": 1735599689, "avatar": "82aefce8216ffc024d457b8b97258639b3d83ac9"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like Warhammer 40.000 and it's Lore and eventhough i 'm sick and tired of Space Marines (i prefer the stories of regular humans), this game depicts the Astartes much more accurate than any other recent game does ... i'm looking at you, DoW >:-(\n\nWhat's especialy recommandible is the fact that this piece of software does not punish you for picking up 1 play-style and sticking with through the entire game, only forcing you to change it, when it's scripted:\nIf you want to use the regular Bolter (like i did), you can do it.\nIf you prefer a more hack 'n slay way of combat, you can do it.\nThere is no wrong answer.\n\nTight controls, smooth running and i encountered no bugs or glitches.\nIf only this game would use the same engine, same or similar mechanics and depict the perspective of regular guardsman, i'd preorder it in an instant.", "timestamp_created": 1511883900, "timestamp_updated": 1511883900, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480158746242523193", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "37883998", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969390324", "personaname": "HumanTarget", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197969390324/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1026, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 995, "last_played": 1632633383, "avatar": "702bc17a7f345fe3f859838cee44abaa3f5d8480"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game had a great sense of joy in the mass slaugter of your enemies.  Fun customization options too.", "timestamp_created": 1511878282, "timestamp_updated": 1511878282, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.500928044319152832", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}